   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Vibrant warm with a teal counterpoint: healthy saturation (0.37), warm highlights (~215/204/195), medium blacks (~23), bright warm skin (~176/142/112), aqua/teal preserved. Best for: Colourful decor, mehendi / haldi / sangeet, South and North Indian ceremonies with lots of marigold and greenery, outdoor day portraits. Gives the "wow" gallery look while keeping skin clean.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
